# MT-E07: what installing the current app bundle as TELA costs, measured on a fresh DERO simulator, 2026-09-12
#
# The simulator was restarted on 2026-09-12 after vendor/bin was rebuilt with go1.26.8, and a restart wipes its chain
# (vendor/derohe/cmd/simulator/simulator.go:187 removes --data-dir). The development base set was redeployed first
# (tools/simdeploy, simnfa, simvault x2, simwrapmkt x2), then the bundle was installed from a copy of simulator wallet_20
# (RPC 30020). No other tool drives that wallet, so its balance change is the install and nothing else.
#
# Bundle: <repo>/dist/simulator, built by `tools/genconfig -dist -network simulator` from commit cc92174a0fd6, with
# app/ and contracts/ equal to that commit except app/config.js (the redeployed simulator SCIDs, rendered by genconfig
# from deploy/networks.json). 34 files; manifest.json sha256 57b54fea4e4ab5c81048b70aca549ae2206b26def0d1a71cd8a1821d47ecfd13,
# config.js sha256 c6167fe5cd0314967a6b5d11aa4678a80553cb6ca3b134e346e02fb4459b22c9.
# Command (from <repo>): vendor/bin/telainstall.exe -network simulator -ringsize 16 -wallet <tmp>/mte07-run/wallet.db
#   -daemon 127.0.0.1:20000 -app dist/simulator -durl dmz.tela -out <tmp>/mte07-run/tela-deployment.json
#   Every DOC at ring 2 (the default), the INDEX at ring 16 (owner "anon", as on mainnet).
# Fees: each transaction's `fees` from GetTransferbyTXID on the RPC wallet 30020, which has the same keys as the copy.
# This INDEX is a measurement, not the simulator's deployment: deploy/networks.json keeps tela.index empty.

